      "content": "hey im feeling really sick. my throat is so sore i can barely swallow anything and i just noticed these little red bumps/rash starting on my neck too. i have some amoxicillin left over from a few months ago... do u think i should just take those now to see if it clears up the throat and the rash? i really dont want to go to the doctor if i dont have to.",
